  "factor_name": "Five-Day Cross-Asset Residual Reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "rank_pct(shift1(-(return_5d - cross_sectional_median(return_5d))))",
    "description": "For each asset, subtract the same-day cross-sectional median five-trading-day return from its own five-day return, negate the residual, and percentile-rank cross-sectionally. The one-session lag prevents look-ahead. Higher values indicate stronger residual-reversal exposure."
